Description: Ask about name clashes in the Wild OS clash dialog
 When a copy or move meets an item with the same name, KIO's widget
 delegate asks org.wildos.Dialogs (wildos-portal) instead of showing
 KIO::RenameDialog: Replace, Skip or Keep both with the dates and sizes,
 and "Do this for every clash in this copy". Keep both names the copy
 "Name (2)" as Files and Windows do, also for every later clash when that
 was chosen for all. The dialog opens above the app's window (x11 id or an
 exported Wayland handle) and closes if the job ends first. Without the
 service KIO's own dialog is shown, so nothing breaks if wildos-portal is
 missing.
Author: Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>
Forwarded: not-needed

